{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54016","headline":"大隐赋附歌 二 · 皇甫松","name":"大隐赋附歌 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾澜起兮风自飘，云溶溶兮连[泬]（沉）寥，微风息兮波以平，云霏霏兮开杳冥。\n重岩邈兮修已远，洄潭渺兮深复浅，羽余觞兮空余罍，玉颜酡兮山已颓，羲皇何以不复回？\n捐形弃世兮如我何哉！金踊跃兮求莫耶，爲不祥兮将奈何！（以上二首檀栾子歌）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}